<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="cc053756">&lt;p&gt;
    Performing this task is a collaborative effort where stakeholders define test environment requirements through working
    sessions.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    When defining requirements for the test environment, consider the following:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        What test levels and test types are defined?
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Is connectivity to external systems needed?
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Is connectivity to ancillary and other internal applications needed?
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        How many batch cycles are required in each test environment per week?
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Is there a need for special batch cycles (month end, year-end) in the test environment?
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Is there a need to generate files or reports from the test environment?
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Is there a need to run special jobs in the test environment?
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Is there a need for to perform a purge or refresh of the test environment with a certain frequency or
        selectivity?&amp;nbsp;
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Is there a need to consider software and hardware requirements such as operating system and security updates?
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="externalId" nodeId="b6919a5f"></attribute>
<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="55ecbcd5"></attribute>
<attribute name="longPresentationName" nodeId="3e26156e"></attribute>
<attribute name="purpose" nodeId="c3b8eb56">&lt;p&gt;
    To enable test execution&amp;nbsp;to be performed.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
